	<key>readme</key>
	<string># Quick paste for your Zoom personal meeting room link

Use a hotkey or 'zp' keyword to paste your Zoom Personal Meeting ID (PMI) link in to whatever context you are working in.

Hold option to add the full meeting invite text.

# To Configure:

Copy your PMI meeting invite to your personal room from Zoom. You can find this in the dropdown menu next to the orange 'New meeting' button on the Zoom home screen.

Your personal link has your 10 digit meeting room ID and then a load of random letters and numbers at the end of the URL after the ```?pwd=```

Here's an example PMI URL:

 ```https://us02web.zoom.us/0123456789?pwd=AHashedVers10nOFY0URpassCodeYZ.1```

Want a nicer looking URL? You can [customise your PMI in Zoom](https://support.zoom.com/hc/en/article?id=zm_kb&amp;sysparm_article=KB0068443)</string>
